          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful! What about specific fruits? I really like apples, kiwi, and watermelon\u2014are these generally safe for acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some fruits good for acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Apples and watermelon are generally safe for acid reflux, as they are low in acidity and can provide relief. Apples can help prevent flare-ups if eaten a few hours before bedtime. Watermelon is also beneficial due to its high water content and neutral acidity. However, kiwi is slightly more acidic, so it's best to consume it in moderation and observe how it affects your symptoms. Overall, focusing on non-citrus fruits like apples and watermelon is a good strategy for managing acid reflux.",
