          "text": "For acid reflux, choose lean proteins like chicken, turkey, and fish, and opt for non-acidic fruits such as bananas, melons, and watermelon. Avoid citrus fruits, pineapple, and fatty meats, as they can worsen symptoms. Are you interested in tips for eating out with acid reflux?",
