      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m curious about which foods are good or bad for acid reflux. Can you give me some ideas?",
          "user_rubrik": "What  food is good for stomach acid reflux and some that I should avoid?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Yogurt can be beneficial for acid reflux, but it depends on the type. Low-fat and plain yogurt with probiotics can help alleviate symptoms, while those with artificial sweeteners or added sugars can worsen it. Greek yogurt is a good option as it contains probiotic live cultures and has a higher protein content, which can help reduce symptoms",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0034-91-08129:6": 7.380611419677734,
            "clueweb22-en0028-98-16066:9": 7.027509689331055,
            "clueweb22-en0045-76-16060:1": 6.971672534942627,
            "clueweb22-en0044-49-16210:1": 6.681793212890625,
            "clueweb22-en0006-74-09876:15": 6.63096284866333
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks! What about fruits? Are there specific ones I should eat or avoid if I have acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik": "What  food is good for stomach acid reflux and some that I should avoid?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For people with acid reflux, it's best to avoid highly acidic fruits like oranges, lemons, limes, grapefruits, and pineapples. On the other hand, non-citrus fruits such as bananas, watermelons, apples, and pears are generally considered safe and may even help alleviate symptoms due to their low acidity levels and high fiber content. Eating these fruits in moderation can be beneficial for managing acid reflux. Additionally, some fruits like bananas and melons can help neutralize stomach acid and provide quick relief from heartburn symptoms.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0041-54-06342:0": 9.300244331359863,
            "clueweb22-en0044-17-08661:3": 8.555342674255371,
            "clueweb22-en0041-54-06342:5": 7.907339096069336,
