            "clueweb22-en0011-83-15566:10": 7.331554889678955
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice, I love apples and watermelon, so that works out for me! Are there any lesser-known fruits that might help with acid reflux, maybe something a bit different?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some fruits good for acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "You might consider trying peaches, as they are also low in acidity and high in fiber, making them a good option for those with acid reflux. Additionally, some people find that eating raw spinach or other green vegetables can help alleviate symptoms, but it's essential to eat them in small, frequent meals to avoid triggering any discomfort. It's always a good idea to consult with a healthcare professional or a registered dietitian for personalized dietary advice on managing acid reflux.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0044-17-08661:3": 6.610909938812256,
            "clueweb22-en0041-54-06342:1": 6.083034515380859,
            "clueweb22-en0010-74-18096:8": 5.538746356964111,
            "clueweb22-en0027-01-14647:8": 5.284606456756592,
            "clueweb22-en0012-22-16674:0": 5.2021684646606445
          },
