        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I want to learn more about foods for acid reflux. Can you tell me which are good and which I should avoid?",
          "user_rubrik": "What  food is good for stomach acid reflux and some that I should avoid?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For acid reflux, good foods include low-acid fruits like bananas and melons, high-fiber options such as oatmeal and whole grains, and lean meats like skinless chicken and fish. Many vegetables like broccoli, carrots, and spinach are also beneficial. Opt for low-fat dairy and healthy fats.\n\nFoods to avoid include fatty and fried items, acidic foods like tomatoes and citrus fruits, raw onions, spicy foods, peppermint, spearmint, beans, dried fruit, and popcorn.",
