          "text": "Fruits that can help soothe acid reflux are generally low in acid and have a higher pH. Excellent choices include bananas, which can coat the esophageal lining, and various melons like watermelon, cantaloupe, and honeydew. Apples and pears are also good options due to their lower acidity. Additionally, berries (strawberries, blackberries, raspberries) and papayas are often recommended for their beneficial properties.",
