          "text": "To manage acid reflux beyond food choices, consider several habits: eat smaller, more frequent meals and avoid eating close to bedtime, ensuring you stay upright afterward. Elevate the head of your bed for sleep. Maintain a healthy weight and exercise regularly. Quitting smoking, limiting alcohol and carbonated beverages, managing stress, and wearing loose-fitting clothes can also significantly help.",
