        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Oh that\u2019s interesting, I already enjoy apples and melons! Are there any less common fruits that help with acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some fruits good for acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Beyond apples and melons, other fruits beneficial for acid reflux include pears, papayas, and mangoes. Pears are low in acid, while papayas contain enzymes that aid digestion. Mangoes are also noted for their low acidity.",
