      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s great, I love mangoes, especially after my trip to Brazil last summer. Are there any habits, besides changing diet, that can help with reflux?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some good habits to help someone with stomach acid reflux?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Beyond diet, several habits can help with acid reflux. Elevate your head during sleep, avoid eating for at least 3 hours before bedtime, and maintain a healthy weight. Managing stress through techniques like meditation or yoga, quitting smoking, and chewing gum after meals can also be beneficial. Additionally, avoid vigorous exercise immediately after eating.",
